[{"title":"寄题先兄祠屋 其二","author":"王夫之","text":"白发青林一径悭，羊裘不拣钓鱼湾。\n当年有誓潭龙窟，身后还悲吊鸟山。\n目送斜阳沈海岸，手栽修竹染霜斑。\n致身录在凭谁读，垆冷香消亦等閒。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1482,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"崇祯癸未贼购捕峻亟先母舅玉卿谭翁以死誓脱某兄弟于虎吻谢世以来仰怀悲哽者三十馀年翁孙以扇索敏侄书字缀为哀吟代书苦不能请先兄俯和益以老泪淫淫承睫不止","author":"王夫之","text":"枫林落叶岳云寒，兄弟披离片影单。\n九族凭谁容破壁，寸心巳许付危湍。\n恩深草屩随拖杖，命续霜刀惜刈兰。\n今日渭阳回首处，萧条白发泪痕乾。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1483,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"别峰庵二如表长老类知子者对众大言天下无和峤之癖者唯船山一汉愧不克任而表师志趣于此徵矣就彼法中得坐脱其宜也诗以吊之","author":"王夫之","text":"延陵未识披裘客，杨亿还疑转盼僧。\n银地界中金屑眼，热油铛里雪山冰。\n相逢歧路双趺印，顾笑县崖一杖登。\n今日重拈唯荐泪，秋山叶落冷孤藤。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1484,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"冬山即事 其一","author":"王夫之","text":"萝阴曲曲謢迥塘，亭午初消子夜霜。\n小藻分波还浸碧，閒花似菊未凋黄。\n游鱼带影双遮水，孤蝶迎晴倍惜香。\n天物殷勤相假借，凋零不遣恼疏狂。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1485,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"冬山即事 其二","author":"王夫之","text":"元绡垂幕黛烟流，略挂西峰玉一钩。\n萧散云还沈碧海，清空人欲访琼楼。\n匀匀广野疏星度，恻恻寒心片影浮。\n取次閒愁栖泊尽，更谁笙鹤梦丹邱。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1486,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"冬山即事 其三","author":"王夫之","text":"小雪无云宿暧赊，东窗日转半棂斜。\n清泉砚滴含馀绿，活火汤瓶涌细花。\n歌哭古今归午枕，江湖图画泛星槎。\n堂堂日月容相问，书卷留人几岁华。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1487,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"冬山即事 其四","author":"王夫之","text":"墙阴小步试欹危，未厌晴风袅鬓丝。\n槠实乍惊飞鸟过，苔阴渐放素光移。\n绀珠千颗垂藤子，丹叶孤飘绕故枝。\n寂历经过聊缓颊，重来千载更伊谁。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1488,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"野史刘生惜十年之别来访山中为写衰容赋赠二首 其一","author":"王夫之","text":"重逢无暇问前游，老去并刀割旧愁。\n风定鳞鳞萍在水，云横脉脉雁当楼。\n频年苦觅蔘苓倦，俭岁无多芋栗收。\n良夜对君霜月迥，还教飞梦泛沧洲。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1489,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"野史刘生惜十年之别来访山中为写衰容赋赠二首 其二","author":"王夫之","text":"弥天无处着衰颜，映水愁窥彻骨寒。\n雁影自宜霜月暗，镜光知向暮春残。\n江门蓑冷添藤笠，易水歌阑尚白冠。\n惭愧云林幽兴绝，还留画里一人看。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1490,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"辛酉日遣怀 其一","author":"王夫之","text":"短烛空烧柏，浊醪不荐椒。\n岁华知几日，人道是今朝。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1491,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"辛酉日遣怀 其二","author":"王夫之","text":"东峰忽散云，飞光射檐端。\n未解消冰雪，晶荧一倍寒。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1492,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"辛酉日遣怀 其三","author":"王夫之","text":"㬉气幸霜馀，留寒酿春雪。\n药力不峥嵘，眉间蹙千缬。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1493,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"辛酉日遣怀 其四","author":"王夫之","text":"手折琼瑶枝，欲以赠远者。\n姑射冰雪姿，乘云不来下。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1494,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"罂粟","author":"王夫之","text":"娇小垂头立，丰盈出面来。\n花王休相妒，侬不向春开。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1495,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"相思子","author":"王夫之","text":"无识自有情，咫尺银河渡。\n不问许多时，渠还在何处。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1496,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"绝句八首 其一","author":"王夫之","text":"黄鸟衔青虫，径飞入深箐。\n蛱蝶绕墙飞，相逢不相见。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1497,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"绝句八首 其二","author":"王夫之","text":"伏日人间暑，西风天际阴。\n秦坑从烈火，鲁壁自清琴。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1498,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"绝句八首 其三","author":"王夫之","text":"莲叶千茎乱，因风捲翠烟。\n飞来双白鸟，不省在谁边。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1499,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"绝句八首 其四","author":"王夫之","text":"瓜架穿萤白，藤梢点露青。\n牵牛花巳发，天上候双星。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1500,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"绝句八首 其五","author":"王夫之","text":"稻花垂金丝，弱如红蓝蕊。\n风起飏蜻蜓，含香点溪水。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1501,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"绝句八首 其六","author":"王夫之","text":"宿鸟波流影，孤萤冷度溪。\n云留分一半，月在柳塘西。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1502,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"绝句八首 其七","author":"王夫之","text":"韎?穿窗人，钱钱缩影高。\n人间酣睡客，几处梦樱桃。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1503,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"绝句八首 其八","author":"王夫之","text":"閒简蝇头字，芭蕉雪里心。\n青青河畔草，自有鬼能吟。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1504,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"敔筑土室授童子读题曰蕉畦口占示之四首 其一","author":"王夫之","text":"治畦当种竹，种蕉为近之。\n虚中同一致，密叶胜疏枝。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1505,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"敔筑土室授童子读题曰蕉畦口占示之四首 其二","author":"王夫之","text":"脆绿怜弱干，勿为霜雪侵。\n春风动雷雨，须长一千寻。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1506,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"敔筑土室授童子读题曰蕉畦口占示之四首 其三","author":"王夫之","text":"莫剪当檐叶，凭传萧瑟音。\n岳峰窗外雨，滴碎汝翁心。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1507,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"敔筑土室授童子读题曰蕉畦口占示之四首 其四","author":"王夫之","text":"题字成元草，绿天幻绛纱。\n勿容贪载酒，何客可名芭。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1508,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"水仙","author":"王夫之","text":"乱拥绿云可奈何，不知人世有春波。\n凡心洗尽留香影，娇小冰肌玉一梭。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1509,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"代书寄衡山戴晋元 其一","author":"王夫之","text":"松梢浅着馀冬雪，兰若閒烧丙夜镫。\n一枕梦回衾似水，不知仙洞隔朱陵。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1510,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"代书寄衡山戴晋元 其二","author":"王夫之","text":"寒山不稳归飞鸟，锦字难传夜静鱼。\n闻说茂陵方病渴，莫修封禅数行书。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1511,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"山月歌","author":"王夫之","text":"船山山半月垂湾，太白光连夕照间。\n白发故人愁不见，天西无数五溪山。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1512,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"白云歌 其一","author":"王夫之","text":"无数閒云出翠微，和风和雨夹山飞。\n孤烟一片如轻絮，自绕疏林款夕晖。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1513,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"白云歌 其二","author":"王夫之","text":"一片轻飞岭上分，当时犹自惜离群。\n飞来飞去秋风里，今日青山无片云。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1514,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"白云歌 其三","author":"王夫之","text":"白云飞也自寻常，不道青山不久长。\n看尽云飞天阙迥，清空一碧映潇湘。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1515,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"白云歌 其四","author":"王夫之","text":"前日浮云飞出山，山前为雨不曾还。\n云收雨散无消息，何似青山一碧閒。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1516,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"白云歌 其五","author":"王夫之","text":"浮云本不恋山巅，木叶随风更可怜。\n欲得归林归不得，蛛丝县挂矮檐边。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1517,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"杂咏 其一","author":"王夫之","text":"曲岸平塘小径通，山坳倚杖避回风。\n知谁扑速林间响，雀啄霜馀数子红。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1518,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"杂咏 其二","author":"王夫之","text":"暝烟欲捲任栖迟，断嶂云光射岭西。\n恰似半晴三月雨，林梢只少子规啼。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1519,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"杂咏 其三","author":"王夫之","text":"罂粟苗轻翠瓣娇，水仙胎满暗香飘。\n丁宁雪霰休凌藉，任打窗前败叶蕉。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1520,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"杂咏 其四","author":"王夫之","text":"问病人稀樾径閒，朝飞孤鸟暮飞还。\n麇䴥避虎昨宵过，乱蹴泥黏碧藓斑。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1521,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"又雪","author":"王夫之","text":"一雪才消一雪飞，不留馀白映霏微。\n何当贳与严陵寿，建武初年守钓矶。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1522,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"送刘生辑夏归省重庆","author":"王夫之","text":"蒸江漱玉绕苍汀，玳瑁霜云拥翠屏。\n归向湘山高顶望，应曕南极老人星。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1523,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"和龟山此日不再得","author":"王夫之","text":"我生秉孱弱，不能任耕桑。\n居然消秫稻，何以酬旻苍。\n星尽晨鸡鸣，东方生炯光。\n良阴无踟踌，俄顷收斜阳。\n行行天地间，南北各有方。\n步履无定审，宇宙空茫茫。\n忮求但自辑，尚未足以臧。\n百端苟遏绝，暗触还自?。\n身心取轻安，未免等秕糠。\n良珠固在握，胡乃忘吾藏。\n春暄熏百草，随类发芬芳。\n秋气净四极，一碧涵清刚。\n春秋皆在斯，何为空徬徨。\n积粟太仓盈，积步万里长。\n踸踔而凌越，竺氏与蒙庄。\n如彼鸟篆空，漫尔矜文章。\n辨说及组绣，慷慨登词场。\n如彼挟策子，与博偕亡羊。\n砭心不知痛，支体皆隳忘。\n何忍蹈此蹊，而更诧豪彊。\n关闽有津济，但自理舟航。\n鼓勇未为殊，绵绵功在常。\n一息不相续，前勤皆巳亡。\n与俗俱汨没，徒为造物伤。\n返念诚自惊，斯须分圣狂。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1524,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"溪上晚步次閒来无日不从容韵","author":"王夫之","text":"溪光空碧净秋容，灼灼斜阳蓼岸红。\n风日不欺樵径好，江山未换钓竿同。\n难分忧乐双行里，谁道穷通一梦中。\n不遣希夷酬上古，乾初一画海天雄。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1525,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"和白沙 其一","author":"王夫之","text":"胡不思身巳有身，桃花柳絮各当春。\n归除共算三辰日，截续无差上古人。\n拔地雷声惊笋梦，弥天雨色养花神。\n他时午夜青天月，恰好金波片影真。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1526,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"和白沙 其二","author":"王夫之","text":"粥饭终朝剧可怜，无心丛里有心天。\n髑髅不爽元生意，枯槁翻新看火然。\n莫撇孤清求鸟径，已知实际历长年。\n分明饶有中和用，不但虚悬未发前。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1527,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"为躬园题用念庵韵 其一","author":"王夫之","text":"历历有此躬，何求而不得。\n即此欲得心，分明无疑惑。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1528,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"为躬园题用念庵韵 其二","author":"王夫之","text":"受来非彼来，应去亦不去。\n云行而雨施，皆予措躬处。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1529,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"读念庵诗次之 其一","author":"王夫之","text":"真静应知动不消，冰霜雷雨总清霄。\n吹镫灭影形还在，炯炯三更伴寂寥。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1530,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"读念庵诗次之 其二","author":"王夫之","text":"碧笋惊雷拔地长，绿筠玉粉土膏香。\n连踵彻顶无涯畔，谁是胞胎秘息方。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1531,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"和白沙 其三","author":"王夫之","text":"问天无意更枯蓍，不道忘情胜马龟。\n蒙叟梦中真蛱蝶，柴桑枕上自轩羲。\n汀洲杜若香原在，海上蓬莱路不疑。\n欲起江门向今日，藤蓑珍重钓珊枝。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1532,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"和白沙 其四","author":"王夫之","text":"百尺峰头泛铁船，情知到我却无缘。\n遥飞青鸟知难致，当顶金乌不易迁。\n一线自循芳草路，双趺直上蜃楼巅。\n劳劳终日心閒极，池上琴尊笑乐天。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1533,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"鼾睡 其一","author":"王夫之","text":"拂拭南窗小榻空，绿阴鏬里纸光红。\n昨朝狼籍今朝在，花自轻飞柳自浓。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1534,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"鼾睡 其二","author":"王夫之","text":"劈破须眉剩脊梁，閒心不耐更商量。\n朦胧稍见东峰上，一片云飞暮雨香。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1535,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"鼾睡 其三","author":"王夫之","text":"薝葡胎玉破新函，白发簪花老自惭。\n冲雨摘来安枕上，香熏华顶老图南。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1536,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"鼾睡 其四","author":"王夫之","text":"挍书如萚埽难穷，且自埋心白昼中。\n为报泉台旧知己，侬非刘向与扬雄。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1537,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"鼾睡 其五","author":"王夫之","text":"春鸟过春不肯鸣，雨中仍听两三声。\n绿光影里还飞去，惊落残红一片轻。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1538,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"鼾睡 其六","author":"王夫之","text":"诗书放下千端在，王霸拈来一点无。\n消受三竿红日影，生成一幅后天图。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1539,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"鼾睡 其七","author":"王夫之","text":"白日惺忪卖影新，人间原有黑甜春。\n梦中不识邯郸道，记得诚斋煞认真。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1540,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"咏怀次韵 其一","author":"王夫之","text":"洪炉片雪陈公甫，独棹中流罗一峰。\n玉露金茎撑九陌，桃花流水度三冬。\n江门孤月元无影，太极丸春自有容。\n传与铁船凭泛海，棹歌声里尽相逢。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1541,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"咏怀次韵 其二","author":"王夫之","text":"不问青天拟问谁，孤琴摇曳动清脾。\n雷声偶逐片云起，轻碧无劳过雨疑。\n几有一沤生旧处，笑看新叶发残枝。\n逢人持此閒供具，啼笑当前换两眉。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1542,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"咏怀次韵 其三","author":"王夫之","text":"纸窗无缝看青山，也觉秋容不放閒。\n瓶水影中莎草岸，菱花曲里白蘋湾。\n他时摇落含春思，昨夜萧清启月颜。\n识得金风消息好，逢场抖擞试痴顽。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1543,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"次定山三首 其一","author":"王夫之","text":"野马从来未受羁，寒原衰草不须辞。\n残山残水谁相问，独笑独歌且浪为。\n日午睡连清旦睡，白沙诗更定山诗。\n青霄明月容迟上，一卷残书了更迟。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1544,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"次定山三首 其二","author":"王夫之","text":"摊书腹内破彭亨，不忆愁从何处生。\n天地病深宜我病，须眉睁后更谁睁。\n醇醪聊借风光酿，仙药无劳雨露耕。\n正自坦然人尽觉，敢矜天马蹑空行。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1545,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"次定山三首 其三","author":"王夫之","text":"溪月溪风太有情，不容尘土得分争。\n乾坤消受无多子，今古萧条第一名。\n梦里青山留我住，镜中白发为谁生。\n炉烟销尽空香满，脉脉幽心只自评。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1546,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"和白沙钓濑与湛民泽收管诗示唐须竹","author":"王夫之","text":"遥山写出虚无画，孤笛吹来雪月吟。\n不是逢人难口说，湘流清浅祝融深。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1547,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"三门滩感兴三首 其一","author":"王夫之","text":"古今皆效动，欲静势不遣。\n古今皆效静，欲动功不展。\n乘之有顺逆，用之有深浅。\n无心即无知，有心智复蹇。\n脉脉以持危，非言能宣显。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1548,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"三门滩感兴三首 其二","author":"王夫之","text":"置身云际观，何为而栖栖。\n延目千秋视，所据皆粉齑。\n目力既有穷，生年不久稽。\n吾心固可引，遥与霄汉齐。\n苟守规中见，安能无笑啼。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":1549,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}}]